{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A House of Lost Spirits. A Game of Power. An Unfolding Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at a lavish yet peculiar hotel and casino, clutching a cryptic telegram signed by one hundred rats. The concierge greets you with polite suspicion and a curious offer. Team up with an ensemble of rodent companions to outwit the establishment\u2019s spectral clientele in games of skill and soul, climbing from low-limit tables to the most exclusive rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/7ad78fd8b240afe432b3e2779f8e3c14.poster.avif?t=1757555608\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/7ad78fd8b240afe432b3e2779f8e3c14.webm?t=1757555608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/7ad78fd8b240afe432b3e2779f8e3c14.mp4?t=1757555608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Multi-Deckbuilding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of crafting and piloting 5 distinct companion decks simultaneously, each performing a unique function on your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful synergies as companions interact and evolve together. Each companion has its own card pools, personality, and strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade Paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect multiple copies of companions to unlock powerful evolutions, transforming their stats and abilities into devastating new forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Economy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our interest system and carefully tuned shop item costs create nail-biting decisions between immediate power and long-term gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/bf88cd3804f0a92c1c2e504d2b7cd82e.avif?t=1757555608\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're Go Face Games and this is our first indie title! Follow us on our journey by wishlisting and joining our Discord community!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931980?t=1757555608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931980?t=1757555608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/2756e6f5e365fd68d5cef45eb1425dd3036d5c04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757555608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/2756e6f5e365fd68d5cef45eb1425dd3036d5c04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757555608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A House of Lost Spirits. A Game of Power. An Unfolding Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at a lavish yet peculiar hotel and casino, clutching a cryptic telegram signed by one hundred rats. The concierge greets you with polite suspicion and a curious offer. Team up with an ensemble of rodent companions to o